title WF04 Lecturer verification - activity
|Lecturer|
start
:Complete academic profile and verify account email;
repeat
  :Select institution and provide staff evidence\n(official profile URL or document);
  :Submit verification request;
  |LumiGap platform|
  :Check eligibility, store evidence privately,\nmark PENDING;
  :Notify administrators queue;
  |Administrator|
  :Open pending request and evidence;
  :Check each source;
  :Decide: approve, ask more info or reject;
  |LumiGap platform|
  :Apply decision to profile and capabilities,\nnotify lecturer;
  |Lecturer|
  :Read decision;
repeat while (Outcome?) is (more information) not (verified or rejected)
if (Verified?) then (verified)
  :Can accept reviews, mentor, validate gaps;
else (rejected)
endif
stop
note right
  Platform invalidates a pending request
  if position or institution changes.
end note
@enduml
